        "id": 7725
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-09-28T14:13:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So I\u0027m a little worried that this will cause future security issues. If someone is developing a new feature (that doesn\u0027t need backward compat) and uses this because the see an `is_admin_project` property, they may not be getting what they think they are getting. Is that possible and if it is can we stop it?",
      "parentUuid": "7a8ec9b2_494c7970",
      "revId": "b78d9cfc463f21516dc0be055dc4e0428c37c637",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543",
      "unresolved": false
    },
